em_assets/steam/apps/3447820/extras/c85436e53c302c6071cd3ed2e57f5a27.avif?t=1739347878\" width=800 height=306 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game contains:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 rockets with unique powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 random events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 types of temporary movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully customizable games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, fun, and totally unpredictable, <strong>this game is the perfect choice to ruin friendships in style</strong>. So, ready to become a general... or just the laughing stock of the universe?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING !!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not designed to be played alone</strong> !!!! You can play it alone to practice if you want, but all the fun is in the multiplayer. <strong>The more you are, the more awesome it is</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "It\u2019s intergalactic chaos right on your couch. Up to 8 players, a single keyboard, and an arena where your ships face off in an explosive ballet. Here, you don\u2019t pilot: you shoot and hope that\u2019s enough to stay alive. Spoiler: it won\u2019t be enough.",
